/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 4 Spell Slot</a> \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation\"> Condition: Supreme Elixir of Arcane Cultivation </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_(Condition)\" title=\"Supreme Elixir of Arcane Cultivation (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Supreme Elixir of Arcane Cultivation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_(Condition)\" title=\"Supreme Elixir of Arcane Cultivation (Condition)\">Supreme Elixir of Arcane Cultivation</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Has an additional <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 4 Spell Slot</a>. Replaces effects from other elixirs when drunk.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">alchemy</a> by combining <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Essence_of_Beholder_Eye\" title=\"Essence of Beholder Eye\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Essence_of_Beholder_Eye_Item_Icon.png/20px-Essence_of_Beholder_Eye_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Essence_of_Beholder_Eye_Item_Icon.png/30px-Essence_of_Beholder_Eye_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Essence_of_Beholder_Eye_Item_Icon.png/40px-Essence_of_Beholder_Eye_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Essence_of_Beholder_Eye_Item_Icon.png/20px-Essence_of_Beholder_Eye_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Essence_of_Beholder_Eye_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Essence_of_Beholder_Eye\" title=\"Essence of Beholder Eye\">Essence of Beholder Eye</a> (procured from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Beholder_Iris\" title=\"Beholder Iris\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Beholder_Iris_Item_Icon.png/20px-Beholder_Iris_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Beholder_Iris_Item_Icon.png/30px-Beholder_Iris_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Beholder_Iris_Item_Icon.png/40px-Beholder_Iris_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Beholder_Iris_Item_Icon.png/20px-Beholder_Iris_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Beholder_Iris_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Beholder_Iris\" title=\"Beholder Iris\">Beholder Iris</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">suspension</a>.</li>\n<li>Sold by any merchant that has the <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_Table\" title=\"Elixir Table\">Elixir Table</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Table\" title=\"Potion Table\">Potion Table</a> <em>starting at level 9</em>; as stock is semi-random, merchants may have anywhere from 0 to 2.</li>\n<li>Possibly obtained by using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Intervention\" title=\"Divine Intervention\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Divine_Intervention_Sunder_the_Heretical_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Intervention_Sunder_the_Heretical_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Divine_Intervention_Sunder_the_Heretical_Icon.webp/30px-Divine_Intervention_Sunder_the_Heretical_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Divine_Intervention_Sunder_the_Heretical_Icon.webp/40px-Divine_Intervention_Sunder_the_Heretical_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Divine Intervention\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Divine_Intervention_Sunder_the_Heretical_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Intervention_Sunder_the_Heretical_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/61/Divine_Intervention_Sunder_the_Heretical_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Intervention\" title=\"Divine Intervention\">Divine Intervention</a> when choosing \"Golden Generosity\".</li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sorcerers can use this elixir to create level 4 spell slots even if they do not meet the level requirements for them (doing so leaves the player character with the spell slots even after drinking another elixir).</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 146.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=